LOCUS       pSHNJ200 3750 bp ds-DNA     circular     18-APR-2025
DEFINITION  .
COMMENT     Imported using the Genbank importer. File name:
            pshnj200-prpu-pt7-sfgfp-j105-mscari-thyb2.gb
            https://academic.oup.com/g3journal/article/12/6/jkac070/6555000 Why
            THyb1 (91% efficient) instead of THyb10 or THyb6 (99% and 91%
            efficient respectively)?  THyb10 could not be cloned, likely
            because the primers form very strong secondary strucutres: THyb10
            terminator strucutre: THyb6 was considered and is quivacal to THyb1
            in T7 transcription terminator efficiency, but THyb1 has higher
            efficiency also with E. coli RNAP than THyb6:
